    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d4">

                <pb facs="0122" n="14" sameAs="frus:frus1893/pg14"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Grant to Mr.
                            Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Vienna</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-05-12"><hi rendition="#italic">May 12, 1893</hi></date>.
                        (Received May 27, 1893.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 360.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to my dispatch, No. 353, under
                    date of April 19 last, giving an account of the arrest of Saul Moerser, alias
                    Charles Mercy, a naturalized citizen of the United States of America, I now have
                    the honor to submit for your information the translation of a note received from
                    the imperial and royal ministry of foreign affairs here, which note should be
                    added to the inclosures of my dispatch, and will complete the file of Charles
                    Mercy’s case. I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Frederick D.
                    Grant.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d4-a1.xml" xpointer="d4-a1"/>
            </div>
